cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Building a Bilingual English–Spanish Parallel Corpus Using
  Multi-Model LLM Translation with Consensus Review
message: >-
  If you use this corpus or the pipeline that produced it, please cite the
  paper below, and also cite the three source datasets listed in
  LICENSE-DATA.md.
type: dataset
