repository-code: 'https://github.com/vsosahdz/SpanishDBText'
abstract: >-
  A bilingual English–Spanish parallel corpus of 12,003 aligned entries and
  23.5 million words, built from WikiText-103, FEVER and Europarl with a
  pipeline of general-purpose large language models: three models translate
  each text in parallel, a reviewer model merges the candidates into a
  consensus translation, and an evaluator model scores the result against a
  calibrated guide that needs no human reference. The repository contains the
  corpus, the per-entry pipeline traces, the pipeline code, the evaluation
  metrics and the analysis notebooks.
keywords:
  - bilingual parallel corpus
  - machine translation
  - large language models
  - multi-model consensus
  - natural language processing
  - Spanish
